/**
 * WHAT A LOCATION READ OUT OF THE RUNNER'S COMMAND LINE NAMES ITSELF, since it names no file.
 *
 * It is a sentinel and it is compared by identity in {@link compiledOutputEvidence}, so a receipt
 * never reads `packages/x/the test command`.
 */
